This file vendors the ``hwsd_extraction.py`` HWSD v2.0 BIL+MDB
extraction helper from the ACEA Data-to-Model Translation Framework
(``DATA-TO-MODEL-TRANSLATION/ACEA/utils/hwsd_extraction.py``). The
ACEA toolkit is the project authors' own open-access framework; the
helper is bundled into prismpy under this notice with the original
authors' authorization (recorded 2026-05-06) so that ``pip install
prismpy`` carries the ACEA HWSD path without requiring the toolkit
to live alongside the prismpy install on disk.

